:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]reliable_notification_snoozing.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]202608/prompts/reliable_notification_snoozing.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-cy[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-cy/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Canonical snooze state and expiry contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-expiry[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-expiry: make the Rust notification store own validated deadlines, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]atomic active-row expiry, resurface metadata, and next-deadline [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]projection.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Deadline-driven ACE reminders[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ace-deadlines[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-expiry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace-deadlines: add a pump-free nearest-deadline coordinator that remains[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reliable across refresh settings, restarts, suspend, clock changes, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notification mutations.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Cross-surface resurface ordering and delivery[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]downstream-resurface[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-expiry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]downstream-resurface: adopt current-state reads and resurface activity [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cursors in CLI, mobile gateway, and Telegram projections so old snoozed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows become new visible activity.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end regression matrix and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]regression-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ace-deadlines, downstream-resurface[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]regression-docs: verify state, timing, ordering, concurrency, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]downstream delivery together and document the resulting guarantees and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recovery behavior.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-cy","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-cy.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a5686444b0ff91ef98896884d1e6b718","started_at":"2026-08-01T10:47:03.047167+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"9e177930a551f7a117cecd91715439c279f9aad468152fb0966d6d17277e7dc6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-cy.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"2b196cea8d5f7935ed63c916697d93f1322c7e8b8724c3ca28ee32383420979a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-cy.4/meta.json","size_bytes":600},"prompt":{"digest":"8dcb841bb8b328bd2f663b9ba69d110fa7956f525f85b0a50507adad4b62a455","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-cy.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":182},"state":{"digest":"a3393076d0559b72be922d25efab85d012ed59c2d715e63d72cd9c8d1df16a80","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-cy.4/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-cy.4","local_name":"sase-cy.4","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-cy","agent_clan_generation":"20260801064646","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-cy.4","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-cy","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","phase_bead_id":"sase-cy.4","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a953ab7af171772005741cc6d6e1feb0","started_at":"20260801064649","state":"waiting"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785585715,"sha":"459ef9786dd1ff5ef39